      "content": "## Pentane Thermophysical Properties Calculator\n\nThis calculator provides thermophysical properties of pentane (C₅H₁₂) at standard conditions (25°C, 1 bara). Pentane is a clear colorless liquid with a petroleum-like odor, commonly used as a specialty solvent.\n\n**Key Properties:**\n- Boiling point: 36°C (97°F)\n- Both liquid and vapor are flammable\n- Heavier than air when vaporized\n- Molecular weight: 72.149 g/mol\n\n**Reference Conditions:** Values given for liquid at 25°C (77°F, 298K) and 1 bara unless otherwise specified.\n"
